-q-p021"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-p001-mingdi-p0077","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p001"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p046-mingdi-p0077","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p046"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-q-p001","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-79022483cd461a542448","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《蜀记》曰：“曹公与刘备围吕布于下邳。关羽启公：布使秦宜禄行求救，乞娶其妻；公许之。临破，又屡启于公。公疑其有异色，先遣迎看；因自留之，羽心不自安。”此与《魏氏春秋》所说无异也。","attribution":"《蜀记》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f214c7b82beace6c970a","start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-p021a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-0b51273f0eff3bb164c4","layer":"pei","quote":"朗父，名宜禄。为吕布使诣袁术，术妻以汉宗室女。其前妻杜氏，留下邳。","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9ebeadb65240878258aa","start":8,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-p021c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-0b51273f0eff3bb164c4","layer":"pei","quote":"宜禄归降，以为铚长。","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9ebeadb65240878258aa","start":82,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-p021d-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-0b51273f0eff3bb164c4","layer":"pei","quote":"及刘备走小沛，张飞随之，过谓宜禄曰：‘人取汝妻，而为之长；乃蚩蚩若是邪！随我去乎？’宜禄从之数里，悔，欲还；飞杀之。","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9ebeadb65240878258aa","start":92,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-p021","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-0b51273f0eff3bb164c4","layer":"pei","quote":"《献帝传》曰：“朗父，名宜禄。为吕布使诣袁术，术妻以汉宗室女。其前妻杜氏，留下邳。布之被围，关羽屡请于太祖，求以杜氏为妻。太祖疑其有色。及城陷，太祖见之，乃自纳之。宜禄归降，以为铚长。及刘备走小沛，张飞随之，过谓宜禄曰：‘人取汝妻，而为之长；乃蚩蚩若是邪！随我去乎？’宜禄从之数里，悔，欲还；飞杀之。朗随母氏，蓄于公宫，太祖甚爱之。每坐席，谓宾客曰：‘世有人爱假子如孤者乎？’”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9ebeadb65240878258aa","start":0,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p046","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fe111e3fae52b8d8ff83","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞晏字平叔。《魏略》曰：“太祖为司空时，纳晏母，并收养晏；其时秦宜禄儿阿苏，亦随母在公家，并见宠如公子；苏即朗也。苏性谨慎。而晏无所顾惮，服饰拟于太子；故文帝特憎之，每不呼其姓字，常谓之为‘假子’。晏尚主，又好色，故黄初时无所事任。及明帝立，颇为冗官。至正始初，曲合于曹爽，亦以才能，故爽用为散骑侍郎，迁侍中、尚书。晏前以尚主，得赐爵为列侯。又其母在内，晏性自喜，动静粉白不去手，行步顾影。晏为尚书，主选举；其宿与之有旧者，多被拔擢。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":385,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-46a3d2d6a327171eb9f7","start":0,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
